                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ca48539-1de4-4675-9f48-f15b9873bd6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "9a186e3e-08b1-3010-82c3-fa881e7073ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "страстно, горячо, с жаром",
                        "target_lang_word": "ardently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ardently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9ff2a75-c309-3459-bce8-8f39c2eff2c7",
                                        "entry_id": "d7be425f-a4b7-3a45-9902-388738aab745",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "fervently"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe2767c8-969b-4719-8ffa-db5f88235717",
                                                "sense_id": "b9ff2a75-c309-3459-bce8-8f39c2eff2c7",
                                                "text": "All scandals aside, Jewish establishment donors and leaders obsessed not only with Jewish continuity but the right kind of continuity—ardently pro-Israel children of two Jewish parents—have failed on their own terms."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7151862b-9c1b-4110-83df-ae06f37b394b",
                        "source_entry_id": "9a186e3e-08b1-3010-82c3-fa881e7073ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "страстно, горячо, с жаром",
                        "target_lang_word": "hotly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hotly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e3dac2e-9489-3734-bea3-7e778a43d9eb",
                                        "entry_id": "e3cc269e-f043-3180-b373-19331a6c557d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With great amounts of heat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "137bd8f6-c49c-33e8-a223-016c5ef2baff",
                                        "entry_id": "e3cc269e-f043-3180-b373-19331a6c557d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a heated manner; intensely or vehemently."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d8485a8-d523-40dc-8486-c46251e50158",
                                                "sense_id": "137bd8f6-c49c-33e8-a223-016c5ef2baff",
                                                "text": "In my excitement I had not been taking notice of other things, and I looked up to see the lord of the harem charging down upon me. Again I fled to the boat, hotly pursued; but this time Maud made no suggestion of turning back."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "164111ae-c0f7-41bd-bb20-5768eeed1ad3",
                                                "sense_id": "137bd8f6-c49c-33e8-a223-016c5ef2baff",
                                                "text": "\"You are really intolerable!\" said I, hotly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e53efe4-297a-4c09-8b47-f2cf59a8315f",
                                                "sense_id": "137bd8f6-c49c-33e8-a223-016c5ef2baff",
                                                "text": "It is interesting that this argument should have come up at this moment,\" Mr. Smith adds, \"when the subject is being debated so hotly in the field of the petrol-driven internal combustion engine.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71c6f5fa-0911-430c-afe7-1efcdbe52568",
                                                "sense_id": "137bd8f6-c49c-33e8-a223-016c5ef2baff",
                                                "text": "The prospective staff redundancy that would ensue from adoption of the plan is, of course, one of the hotly controversial aspects of the proposals and the chief issue on which a three-day N.U.R. strike was threatened for May 14-16, a few days after this issue went to press."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
